mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><div>With the rising public awareness of health and advances in diagnostic and therapeutic equipment for digestive endoscopy, digestive endoscopy is no longer merely an examination tool; it can also perform a wide range of minimally invasive surgical treatments. Digestive endoscopy plays an increasingly vital role in the diagnosis of early cancers, endoscopic resection of early cancers, and the diagnosis and management of submucosal tumors. Moreover, certain conditions that previously required open surgery, such as achalasia, can now be treated via minimally invasive endoscopic procedures.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>The Endoscopy Center of Zhongshan Hospital, Fudan University is one of the first institutions in China to introduce and perform Endoscopic Submucosal Dissection (ESD), with many of its novel technologies reaching world-leading standards.</div></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
